# installed, relocated package and run on build/release/images/boot-stub.exec, diag-cpu-1.ivsc and (plan 05-11)
# diag-ctrl-psg-1.ivsc (gate step pkg-install). Self-consistent, not independent: the emulator produced these values.
# The digest.<domain> lines must also equal data/golden/diag-input-pass.digests (cross-path
# agreement with the runner); since plan 05-11 its ctrl.digest.<domain> lines and observed domains must equal
# data/golden/diag-ctrl-psg-pass.digests (the replay of diag-ctrl-psg-pass through the installed headers, the
# peeked $01FE after the first event is 0x007E, the new lines are additions only). The step drops these # lines before comparing. A change is a
# reviewed diff, regenerated from build/gate/pkg-consumer.txt after a gate run.
